#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/tools/lower_trace/core/index.rst:134
msgid ""
"Force a trace mode (``'terminal'``, ``'html'``, ``'both'``, or ``None`` to "
"disable).  When omitted, the mode is read from the ``TL_LOWER_TRACE`` env "
"var (via ``tilelang.env``) or a prior ``enable`` override."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/tools/lower_trace/core/index.rst:139
msgid ""
"Force the trace output base directory.  When omitted, falls back to the "
"``TL_LOWER_TRACE_DIR`` env var, then ``./tmp/lower_trace_dir``."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/tools/lower_trace/core/index.rst:143
msgid ""
"Path to save the codegen-generated C++/CUDA/etc. source code.  When omitted, "
"defaults to ``<script_dir>/codegen.cpp`` (inside the per-script output "
"directory, beside ``.run_records/``).  Pass ``None`` explicitly to suppress "
"all extra saves.  See ``_wrap_codegen_ffi`` for the three-file (``<path>`` / "
"``<path>.original`` / ``<path>.latest``) patch-and-recompile workflow."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../autoapi/tilelang/tools/lower_trace/core/index.rst:161
msgid ""
"``_script_dir`` is preserved (stable across runs, holds codegen files + html "
"symlink).  ``_run_dir`` is also preserved: clearing it here would split a "
"single run into two directories, because pre-pipeline passes (which lazily "
"create it via ``_ensure_run_dir``) run before ``PassPipeline.lower``/"
"``_wrap_phase`` invokes ``reset`` on its first run. A fresh ``_run_dir`` for "
"each subsequent run is instead established directly in "
"``_traced_pipeline_lower`` / ``_wrap_phase`` (when ``_run_counter > 1``), "
"without calling ``reset`` so that records keep accumulating across runs."
msgstr ""
